{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲把温暖记忆越鲜活、过去越无法原样回来所带来的刺痛，连到不舍、反复追问和身体紧绷，并指出早先的用力反而会加深眷恋、身体也可能先于自问收紧；但它对92–107到108–115的情绪突变、持续用力如何进一步转成疲惫，以及半音下行所形成的反向拉扯解释不足。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙较清楚地串起了快乐与失去的预感如何并存、熟悉的坚定为何不再足以提供安全感、身体如何先于念头急起并在持续用力后疲惫，以及思绪如何接过寻找把握的任务、最终从求解变成避免停下的办法；但它没有像甲那样直接点明过去无法原样回来的刺痛核心，对半音下行的反向力量也未作具体解释，部分因果还依赖H编号所指的前史。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"虽然甲更直接地抓住了过去不可复得这一痛感来源，但乙对段内转折、身体先于念头的反应、持续用力造成的消耗，以及反复思考如何转变为应对方式，提供了更完整的因果链，而半音下行这一具体音乐线索的遗漏并非乙相对于甲的实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "91b23308-fd69-456a-8a4a-8a6b70bb85f9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135442451831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 142.156, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:57:04.616493+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a2ae1c7f9b5900529dc79375e2bf189f5369d377fbd169a3ed0c00042f777d4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f1